<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Jefferson Driving School - Learn to Drive with Confidence</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/css/all.min.css">

    <style>
        :root {
            --primary-red: #c00000;
            --black: #000000;
            --white: #ffffff;
            --yellow: #ffcc00;
            --light-gray: #f8f9fa;
            --dark-gray: #333333;
        }

        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        body {
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
            color: var(--dark-gray);
        }

        .container {
            max-width: 1200px;
            margin: auto;
            padding: 0 15px;
        }

        /* HEADER */
        header {
            background: var(--black);
            color: var(--white);
            position: sticky;
            top: 0;
            z-index: 1000;
        }

        .header-container {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            padding: 15px 0;
        }

        .logo {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 10px;
            font-weight: 700;
            font-size: 1.4rem;
        }

        .logo-icon {
            background: var(--primary-red);
            width: 40px;
            height: 40px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
        }

        .contact-info {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 15px;
        }

        .contact-info a {
            color: var(--white);
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: 600;
        }

        /* HERO SECTION */
        .hero {
            background: url("https://raw.githubusercontent.com/nicholaskock33-tech/jefferson/main/ChatGPT%20Image%20Dec%2016,%202025,%2002_21_45%20AM.png")
                no-repeat center center;
            background-size: cover;
            background-position: center 25%;
            position: relative;
            padding: 120px 0;
            color: var(--white);
            text-align: center;
        }

        .hero::before {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            inset: 0;
            background: linear-gradient(
                to right,
                rgba(0,0,0,0.75),
                rgba(192,0,0,0.65)
            );
            z-index: 1;
        }

        .hero-content {
            position: relative;
            z-index: 2;
            max-width: 800px;
            margin: auto;
        }

        .hero h1 {
            font-size: 2.8rem;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            text-shadow: 2px 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.7);
        }

        .hero p {
            font-size: 1.3rem;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
            text-shadow: 2px 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.7);
        }

        .cta-buttons {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 15px;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
        }

        .btn {
            padding: 15px 30px;
            border-radius: 50px;
            font-weight: 700;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-size: 1.1rem;
        }

        .btn-whatsapp {
            background: #25D366;
            color: white;
        }

        .btn-call {
            background: white;
            color: var(--primary-red);
        }

        section {
            padding: 60px 0;
        }

        .section-title {
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 2rem;
            margin-bottom: 40px;
        }

        .services {
            background: var(--light-gray);
        }

        .services-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr));
            gap: 30px;
        }

        .service-card {
            background: white;
            padding: 30px;
            border-radius: 10px;
            text-align: center;
            box-shadow: 0 5px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
        }

        .service-icon {
            width: 60px;
            height: 60px;
            background: var(--primary-red);
            color: white;
            border-radius: 50%;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            margin: auto auto 20px;
            font-size: 26px;
        }

        .about p {
            max-width: 800px;
            margin: auto;
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            text-align: center;
        }

        /* GALLERY */
        .gallery {
            background: var(--light-gray);
        }

        .gallery-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr));
            gap: 20px;
        }

        .gallery-grid img {
            width: 100%;
            height: 250px;
            object-fit: cover;
            border-radius: 10px;
        }

        /* FOOTER */
        footer {
            background: var(--black);
            color: white;
            padding: 40px 0;
            text-align: center;
        }

        @media(max-width: 768px) {
            .hero h1 {
                font-size: 2rem;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>

<header>
    <div class="container header-container">
        <div class="logo">
            <div class="logo-icon"><i class="fas fa-car"></i></div>
            Jefferson Driving School
        </div>
        <div class="contact-info">
            <a href="tel:0789016352">078 901 6352</a>
            <a href="https://wa.me/27789016352" class="btn-whatsapp">WhatsApp</a>
        </div>
    </div>
</header>

<section class="hero">
    <div class="hero-content">
        <h1>Trusted Driving School in Knysna</h1>
        <p>Code 8 & Code 10 • K53 Certified • Open 7 Days a Week</p>
        <div class="cta-buttons">
            <a href="https://wa.me/27789016352" class="btn btn-whatsapp">
                <i class="fab fa-whatsapp"></i> Book via WhatsApp
            </a>
            <a href="tel:0789016352" class="btn btn-call">
                <i class="fas fa-phone"></i> Call Now
            </a>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="services">
    <div class="container">
        <h2 class="section-title">We Specialise In</h2>
        <div class="services-grid">
            <div class="service-card"><div class="service-icon"><i class="fas fa-car"></i></div>Code 8 Lessons</div>
            <div class="service-card"><div class="service-icon"><i class="fas fa-truck"></i></div>Code 10 Lessons</div>
            <div class="service-card"><div class="service-icon"><i class="fas fa-chalkboard-teacher"></i></div>K53 Training</div>
            <div class="service-card"><div class="service-icon"><i class="fas fa-user-graduate"></i></div>Learner Training</div>
            <div class="service-card"><div class="service-icon"><i class="fas fa-clipboard-check"></i></div>Learner Test Prep</div>
            <div class="service-card"><div class="service-icon"><i class="fas fa-id-card"></i></div>Driver Test Prep</div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="about">
    <div class="container">
        <h2 class="section-title">About Us</h2>
        <p>
            Jefferson Driving School is a well-established driving school in Knysna,
            Plettenberg Bay, and Sedgefield. Affordable, punctual, and open
            Monday to Sunday from 7am to 7pm. Your driving school is just a WhatsApp away.
        </p>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="gallery">
    <div class="container">
        <h2 class="section-title">Our Happy Clients</h2>
        <div class="gallery-grid">
            <img src="https://placehold.co/400x300?text=Happy+Client">
            <img src="https://placehold.co/400x300?text=Driving+Lesson">
            <img src="https://placehold.co/400x300?text=Licence+Success">
            <img src="https://placehold.co/400x300?text=Confidence+Built">
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<footer>
    <p>Service Areas: Knysna | Plettenberg Bay | Sedgefield</p>
    <p>Reliable • Affordable • Professional</p>
</footer>

</body>
</html>
